<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in October.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in October.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published the following data relating to M3 money supply in October.</p>
<p>AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	   Oct    Sep   Oct 95 EndOct</p>
<p>									 Level 1)</p>
<p>BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)		 +46.0  +18.6 +39.1  4,680.5</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	     0.0    0.0  -0.1     8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		  +46.0  +18.6 +39.2  4,671.8</p>
<p>   To firms and individuals	+17.1  +19.3 +14.4  3,525.4</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    short term lending		-1.1   +9.0  -2.7   593.4</p>
<p>    To public authorities	  +28.9   -0.7 +24.8  1,146.4 2)</p>
<p>NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK		 -9.2   +6.8 -16.3   289.9 3)</p>
<p>MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>   FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL   +9.3   +8.1 +12.3  2,707.8</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>     4 yrs and more		   +4.6   +2.6  +3.4   786.1</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>     notice, savings certificates +0.7   +0.1  -0.3   499.0</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>     in circulation		   +2.8   +4.0  +7.7  1,091.9 4)</p>
<p>DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		  +0.1   +0.4  -2.1     0.5 5)</p>
<p>OTHER FACTORS			  +16.8   +8.0  +6.3   212.4 6)</p>
<p>MONEY STOCK M3			 +10.6   +8.8  +6.3  2,049.6</p>
<p>    Currency in circulation	 +1.0   +0.2  -0.9   241.2</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		   +10.5  +13.3  +9.9   579.8</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs     -7.7   -8.9 -13.0   400.0</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>     three months notice	    +6.7   +4.3 +10.3   828.7</p>
